#536=DESCRIPTIVE_REPRESENTATION_ITEM('equivalent unicode string',
'NOTE\\wNOTES (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED):\\n \\n1. CAD MODEL _______
____ REV. __ IS REQUIRED\\n    TO COMPLETE PRODUCT DEFINITION.\\n \\n2.
 DIRECTLY-TOLERANCED DIMENSIONS AND\\n    BASIC DIMENSIONS DEFINED ON 
THE DRAWING\\n    TAKE PRECEDENCE OVER DIMENSIONAL DATA\\n    DEFINED 
BY THE MODEL. OBTAIN ALL OTHER\\n    DIMENSIONAL DATA FROM THE MODEL. 
THE\\n    MODEL REPRESENTS BASIC DIMENSIONAL DATA\\n    UNLESS OTHERWI
SE SPECIFIED.\\n \\n3. APPLICABLE STANDARDS:\\n    ASME Y14.41-2003 AP
PLIES TO DATASET.\\n    ASME Y14.5M-1994 APPLIES TO DIMENSIONING\\n   
 AND TOLERANCING.\\n \\n4. <&70><+><&6><+>.06<+>A<+>B<+>C<+><&90> APPL
IES TO ALL\\n    UNTOLERANCED SURFACES.\\n \\n5. DIMENSIONING AND TOLE
RANCING\\n    APPLY WITH PART RESTRAINED AS\\n    FOLLOWS, EXCEPT AS I
NDICATED.\\n\\n    PLACE DATUM FEATURE A AGAINST\\n    DATUM FEATURE S
IMULATOR A.\\n\\n    ENGAGE DATUM FEATURES B\\n    AND C WITH DATUM FE
ATURE\\n    SIMULATORS B AND C\\n    RESPECTIVELY.\\n\\n    APPLY LOAD
 TO PART TO\\n    RESTRAIN DATUM FEATURE\\n    A AGAINST ITS SIMULATOR.
\\n\\n    DETAILED INSPECTION PLAN\\n    NEEDED TO COMPLETELY\\n    DE
FINE RESTRAINT.\\n\\n6. UNITS: INCHES');
